        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "On day two, the route continues through the Bolivian highlands.\n\nYou visit 3 lagoons: Laguna Honda, Laguna Hedionda and Laguna Cañapa. The road then crosses the Siloli Desert to the Stone Tree, one of the region’s distinctive rock formations.\n\nContinue to Ollagüe volcano and Puerto Chuvica. The volcano is active, and smoke can be seen rising from its crater.\n\nOvernight at a hotel built from salt."
    },
